{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a relaxing underwater adventure in <i>Cozy Fish Game</i>!</strong><br>In this charming eat-or-be-eaten arcade game, you start off as a tiny fish in a big ocean. Swim, grow, and explore a vibrant aquatic world filled with friendly critters, hidden treasures, and hungry predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udeb8 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f <strong>Eat and Grow</strong>: Devour smaller fish to grow bigger \u2014 but watch out for those who want to eat you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Chill Gameplay</strong>: Perfect for short breaks or long sessions \u2014 low-stress, high-satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Colorful World</strong>: Hand-crafted underwater environments full of life and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Soothing Atmosphere</strong>: Relaxing music and smooth animations that make the ocean feel alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're looking to unwind or challenge yourself with survival tactics, <strong>Cozy Fish Game</strong> offers a wholesome, bite-sized experience for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to make some waves?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760280?t=1748485572","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760280?t=1748485572","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760280/3254b94f73ae9df06686529aa8bf6c48865f53c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748485572","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760280/3254b94f73ae9df06686529aa8bf6c48865f53c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748485572","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a relaxing underwater adventure in <i>Cozy Fish Game</i>!</strong><br>In this charming eat-or-be-eaten arcade game, you start off as a tiny fish in a big ocean. Swim, grow, and explore a vibrant aquatic world filled with friendly critters, hidden treasures, and hungry predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udeb8 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f <strong>Eat and Grow</strong>: Devour smaller fish to grow bigger \u2014 but watch out for those who want to eat you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Chill Gameplay</strong>: Perfect for short breaks or long sessions \u2014 low-stress, high-satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Colorful World</strong>: Hand-crafted underwater environments full of life and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Soothing Atmosphere</strong>: Relaxing music and smooth animations that make the ocean feel alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're looking to unwind or challenge yourself with survival tactics, <strong>Cozy Fish Game</strong> offers a wholesome, bite-sized experience for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to make some waves?</p>","developers":["me"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760280/67ba7f5701fa6ecf5ee40ecbb03d9980274fbf89/header.jpg?t=1748485572","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144609,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144609/movie480.mp4?t=1748485570","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144609/movie_max.mp4?t=1748485570"},"name":"1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/